{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L=1, adjoint: SoV in the new conventions (clean)\n\nThis is the clean version of `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb`. It keeps only the final formulas and the checks that establish them; the exploration (failed operator forms, ansatz scans) stays in the original. It is self-contained: the first cell clears the kernel. Full write-up: `Companion-B-C-diagonalize-clean.md` / `.tex`.\n\n**Conventions.**\n- **Lax.** $\\mathcal L_{ij}(u)=u\\,\\delta_{ij}+h\\,E_{ij}$, with $T_{ij}(u)=\\mathcal L_{ij}(u-\\theta)$ and one site.\n- **Twist.** Companion form $G(z)=\\begin{pmatrix}\\chi_1&-\\chi_2&\\chi_3\\\\1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$, with $\\chi_k$ the elementary symmetric polynomials of $z$, acting on the right: $T^G=\\mathcal L\\,G$.\n- **Quantum minors.** Rows are antisymmetrized and column $k$ is evaluated at $u-(k-1)h$. The transfer matrices are $t_a=\\sum_{|I|=a}\\mathrm{qmin}_{I,I}[T^G]$.\n- **Factors.** $\\nu_n(u)=u-\\theta+h\\lambda_n$, with rep $\\lambda=(2,1,0)$.\n- **Q-functions.** *Direct* $Q_i=z_i^{-u/h}q_i$ and *dual* $Q^j=z_j^{+u/h}q^j$, with the $q$'s monic. The shift notation is $Q^{[2k]}(u)=Q(u+kh)$.\n\n**Numeric point** (one point; every shift is in units of $h$): $h=1/2$, $\\theta=2/7$, $z=(3/2,5/4,2/3)$ so $\\chi_3=5/4$, and second twist $w=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$.\n\nThe last cell tabulates every check.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Representation and transfer matrices",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* fresh kernel state so the notebook is self-contained; this also clears the other new-conventions notebooks' session state (their files are untouched) *)\nClearAll[\"Global`*\"];\n(* GT basis and gl(3) generators, verbatim from the original notebook *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];\nchecks = <||>;",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol ClearGlobals is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeCleanupImgDir is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">ClearAll::wrsym: Symbol VsCodeDynExportValue is Protected.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of ClearAll::wrsym will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
