  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. B and C operators and the SoV bases\n$B(u)=T_{11}(u)\\,\\mathrm{qmin}_{12,12}[T](u+h)+T_{21}(u)\\,\\mathrm{qmin}_{12,13}[T](u+h)$, and $C(u)$ is the same with the minors at $u$; both use the **untwisted** $T$.\n\nThe bases are labelled by GT patterns $\\mu=\\{\\{\\mu_{11}\\},\\{\\mu_{21},\\mu_{22}\\}\\}$:\n- **$\\langle x_\\mu|$.** Built from $\\langle x_0|=e_1^T$ (pattern $\\{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}\\}$) by fused $t$'s at $\\theta-2h$. They are B-eigencovectors with eigenvalue $(u-\\theta+h\\mu_{11}+h)(u-\\theta+h\\mu_{21})(u-\\theta+h\\mu_{22})$.\n- **$|y_\\mu\\rangle$.** Built from $|y_{\\rm low}\\rangle=e_8$ (pattern $\\{\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\}\\}$) by shifted $t$'s at $\\theta$. They are C-eigenvectors with eigenvalue $(u-\\theta+h\\mu_{11})(u-\\theta+h\\mu_{21})(u-\\theta+h\\mu_{22}-h)$.\n\nThe overlap matrix $\\langle x_\\mu|y_\\nu\\rangle$ is triangular and independent of $z$, with $\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle=9h^4$, where $y_0=y_{\\{2\\},\\{2,1\\}}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "QMu = qminor[T];\nBop[u_] = T[1, 1][u] . QMu[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u + h] + T[2, 1][u] . QMu[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u + h];\nCop[u_] = T[1, 1][u] . QMu[{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u] + T[2, 1][u] . QMu[{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u];\ngtpats = {{{2}, {2, 1}}, {{2}, {1, 1}}, {{1}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {2, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 0}}, {{2}, {0, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 0}}, {{1}, {0, 0}}};\nx0pat = {{2}, {2, 1}}; ylowpat = {{1}, {0, 0}};\nxm2 = θ - 2 h;\nxB[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = {UnitVector[8, 1]};\nxB[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = xB[{{2}, {2, 1}}] . tF[{1, 0}, xm2];\nxB[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = xB[{{2}, {2, 1}}] . tF[{1, 1}, xm2];\nxB[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = xB[{{2}, {2, 1}}] . tF[{2, 0}, xm2] . Inverse[tF[{1, 0}, xm2]];\nxB[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = xB[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tF[{1, 0}, xm2];\nxB[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = xB[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tF[{2, 0}, xm2];\nxB[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = xB[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tF[{1, 1}, xm2];\nxB[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = xB[{{2}, {2, 0}}] . tF[{2, 1}, xm2];\n(* shifted fused t's that build the C-eigenbasis *)\ntS[{1, 0}, v_] := tF[{1, 0}, v]; tS[{1, 1}, v_] := tF[{1, 1}, v + h]; tS[{2, 0}, v_] := tF[{2, 0}, v - h];\ntS[{2, 1}, v_] := tGt[zs, 2, v + h] . tGt[zs, 1, v - h] - tGt[zs, 3, v + h];\nyB[{{1}, {0, 0}}] = Transpose[{UnitVector[8, 8]}];\nyB[{{2}, {0, 0}}] = Simplify[tS[{2, 0}, θ] . Inverse[tF[{1, 0}, θ]] . yB[{{1}, {0, 0}}]];\nyB[{{1}, {1, 0}}] = tS[{1, 0}, θ] . yB[{{1}, {0, 0}}];\nyB[{{2}, {1, 0}}] = tS[{1, 0}, θ] . yB[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\nyB[{{2}, {2, 0}}] = tS[{2, 0}, θ] . yB[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\nyB[{{1}, {1, 1}}] = tS[{1, 1}, θ] . yB[{{1}, {0, 0}}];\nyB[{{2}, {1, 1}}] = tS[{1, 1}, θ] . yB[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\nyB[{{2}, {2, 1}}] = tS[{2, 1}, θ] . yB[{{2}, {0, 0}}];\nchecks[\"<x_mu| are B eigencovectors\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Table[xB[μ] . Bop[u] - xB[μ] (u - θ + h μ[[1, 1]] + h) (u - θ + h μ[[2, 1]]) (u - θ + h μ[[2, 2]]), {μ, gtpats}]]]] === {0};\nchecks[\"|y_mu> are C eigenvectors\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Table[Cop[u] . yB[μ] - yB[μ] (u - θ + h μ[[1, 1]]) (u - θ + h μ[[2, 1]]) (u - θ + h μ[[2, 2]] - h), {μ, gtpats}]]]] === {0};\ngramXY = Table[Simplify[(xB[a1] . yB[a2])[[1, 1]]], {a1, gtpats}, {a2, gtpats}];\nx0y0 = gramXY[[1, 1]];\nchecks[\"<x0|y0> = 9h^4\"] = Simplify[x0y0 - 9 h^4] === 0;\nchecks[\"<x|y> independent of z\"] = FreeQ[gramXY, z];\n{checks[\"<x_mu| are B eigencovectors\"], checks[\"|y_mu> are C eigenvectors\"], MatrixForm[gramXY]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
