       "data": "Out[909]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\mathrm{True},\\mathrm{True} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\begin{pmatrix}9\\,h^4 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 9\\,h^4 & 0 & 3\\,h^4 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 18\\,h^4 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0 & 6\\,h^4 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 6\\,h^4 & 0 & 0 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 6\\,h^4 & 3\\,h^4 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 9\\,h^4 & 0\\\\0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 9\\,h^4\\end{pmatrix}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "716ca7a5-a548-42bc-8a21-7f940665ceec"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Frames: companion and diagonal twist\n$\\Omega_L=e_1^TP_{pp}$ is the companion vacuum, with eigenvalue $\\tau_{\\rm vac}(u)=\\sum_jz_j\\nu_j(u)$. The Gauss factors $P_{\\rm aux}$ (auxiliary space) and $P_{\\rm phys}$ (physical space) satisfy:\n- $P_{\\rm aux}G(z)P_{\\rm aux}^{-1}=\\mathrm{diag}(z)$;\n- $P_{\\rm phys}\\,t_1(z)\\,P_{\\rm phys}^{-1}=\\sum_iz_i\\mathcal L_{ii}(u-\\theta)$, which is justified by gl(3) invariance of the Lax operator.\n\nThe second twist $w$ written in the frame where $G(z)$ is diagonal is $G_{P,zw}=P_{\\rm aux}G(w)P_{\\rm aux}^{-1}$. Its transfer matrix `tGPzw` has the vacuum covector $\\Omega_{zw}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "τvac[tw_][u_] := Sum[tw[[j]] ν[j][u], {j, 3}];\nee[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii] KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];\nLL = Sum[KroneckerProduct[ee[i, j], ℒ[i, j][u]], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nchecks[\"gl(3) invariance of the Lax operator\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Table[LL . (KroneckerProduct[ee[i, j], IdentityMatrix[8]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[3], -Ee[j, i]]) - (KroneckerProduct[ee[i, j], IdentityMatrix[8]] + KroneckerProduct[IdentityMatrix[3], -Ee[j, i]]) . LL, {i, 3}, {j, 3}]]]] === {0};\nPpp = MatrixExp[(1/z[1]) Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[-(1/(z[1] z[2])) Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[((z[1] + z[2])/(z[1] z[2])) Ee[2, 3]];\nPmp = MatrixExp[r[1] Ee[3, 2]] . MatrixExp[r[2] Ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[r[3] Ee[2, 1]];\nPdp = MatrixExp[Log[s[1]] Ee[1, 1]] . MatrixExp[Log[s[2]] Ee[2, 2]] . MatrixExp[Log[s[3]] Ee[3, 3]];\nPpa = MatrixExp[-(1/z[1]) ee[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[(1/(z[1] z[2])) ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[-((z[1] + z[2])/(z[1] z[2])) ee[3, 2]];\nPma = MatrixExp[-r[1] ee[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[-r[2] ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[-r[3] ee[1, 2]];\nPda = MatrixExp[-Log[s[1]] ee[1, 1]] . MatrixExp[-Log[s[2]] ee[2, 2]] . MatrixExp[-Log[s[3]] ee[3, 3]];\nrsSol = {s[1] -> z[1]^2/((z[1] - z[2]) (z[1] - z[3])), s[2] -> -(z[2]/(z[1] (z[2] - z[3]))), s[3] -> 1/(z[1] z[2]), r[1] -> -(z[3]/z[2]), r[2] -> -(z[3]/z[1]), r[3] -> (z[2]^2 (-z[1] + z[3]))/(z[1]^2 (z[2] - z[3]))};\nPaux = Simplify[Pma . Pda . Ppa /. rsSol];\nPphys = Simplify[Pmp . Pdp . Ppp /. rsSol];\nPphysInv = Simplify[Inverse[Ppp] . Inverse[Pdp] . Inverse[Pmp] /. rsSol];\nchecks[\"Paux G(z) Paux^-1 = diag(z)\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Paux . Gc[zs] . Inverse[Paux] - DiagonalMatrix[zs]]]] === {0};\nchecks[\"Pphys t1(z) Pphys^-1 = sum z_i L_ii\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Pphys . tGz[[1]] . PphysInv - Sum[ℒ[i, i][u - θ] z[i], {i, 3}]]]] === {0};\nΩL = {UnitVector[8, 1]} . Ppp;\nchecks[\"Omega_L companion vacuum\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[ΩL . tGz[[1]] - τvac[zs][u] ΩL]]] === {0};\nGPzw = Simplify[Paux . Gc[ws] . Inverse[Paux]];\ntGPzw[u_] = Sum[ℒ[i, k][u - θ] GPzw[[k, i]], {i, 3}, {k, 3}];\nΩzw = {UnitVector[8, 1]} . MatrixExp[r1 Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[r2 Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[r3 Ee[2, 3]] /. {r1 -> (w[1] - z[1])/(w[1] - z[2]), r2 -> ((w[1] - z[1]) (-w[2] + z[1]) (z[2] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (w[2] - z[3])), r3 -> ((w[1] - z[2]) (-w[2] + z[2]) (z[1] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (-w[2] + z[3]))};\nchecks[\"Omega_zw vacuum of tGPzw\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Ωzw . tGPzw[u] - Ωzw τvac[ws][u]]]] === {0};\nKeyTake[checks, {\"gl(3) invariance of the Lax operator\", \"Paux G(z) Paux^-1 = diag(z)\", \"Pphys t1(z) Pphys^-1 = sum z_i L_ii\", \"Omega_L companion vacuum\", \"Omega_zw vacuum of tGPzw\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"128\" data-out-n=\"932\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"7\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[932]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.5em;vertical-align:-3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4em;\"><span style=\"top:-6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gl(3) invariance of the Lax operator</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Paux G(z) Paux</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1 = diag(z)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pphys t1(z) Pphys</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-1 = sum z_i L_ii</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Omega_L companion vacuum</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.16em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Omega_zw vacuum of tGPzw</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[932]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{gl(3) invariance of the Lax operator}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{Paux G(z) Paux\\^{}-1 = diag(z)}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{Pphys t1(z) Pphys\\^{}-1 = sum z\\_i L\\_ii} \\\\\n  &\\to \\mathrm{True},\\text{Omega\\_L companion vacuum}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{Omega\\_zw vacuum of tGPzw}\\to \\mathrm{True}\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "421b635f-12c7-4024-b42d-df7cd466fec8"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 4. Eigenstates, Baxter equations, QQ relation\n**Direct equation** (on $Q_i=z_i^{-x/h}q_i$, with $\\deg q_i=\\lambda_1-\\mu_i$):\n$$\\nu_1(x)\\nu_1(x+h)\\nu_1(x+2h)Q(x-h)-t_1(x)\\nu_1(x+h)\\nu_1(x+2h)Q(x)+t_2(x+h)\\nu_1(x+2h)Q(x+h)-t_3(x+2h)Q(x+2h)=0.$$\n**Dual equation** (on $Q^j=z_j^{+x/h}q^j$, with $\\deg q^j=\\mu_j-\\lambda_3$), in uniform form:\n$$\\nu_3(x)\\nu_3(x-h)\\nu_3(x-2h)Q(x+h)-t_1(x)\\nu_3(x-h)\\nu_3(x-2h)Q(x)+t_2(x)\\nu_3(x-2h)Q(x-h)-t_3(x)Q(x-2h)=0.$$\n**QQ relation** (polynomial parts; the exponentials differ by $\\chi_3^{-u/h}$):\n$$Q_a(u)Q_b(u+h)-Q_b(u)Q_a(u+h)\\propto\\Big(\\tfrac1{z_b}-\\tfrac1{z_a}\\Big)F_\\lambda(u)Q^c(u),\\qquad F_\\lambda=\\prod_{n=\\lambda_2+1}^{\\lambda_1}(u-\\theta+nh).$$\nThe weight $\\mu$ of a state is read off from $t_1(\\theta)=h\\sum_iz_i\\mu_i$, i.e. in the frame where the twist is diagonal.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "pt = {h -> 1/2, θ -> 2/7, z[1] -> 3/2, z[2] -> 5/4, z[3] -> 2/3, w[1] -> 5/2, w[2] -> 7/3, w[3] -> 3/5};\nprec = 60; hN = h /. pt; thN = θ /. pt;\n(* max |coefficient| of a polynomial in var; the 0 floor handles an exactly-zero polynomial (empty coefficient list) *)\nmaxc[e_, var_] := Max[Abs[Flatten[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[e], 10^-40], var]]], 0];\nwts = Union[Table[J0[k][p], {p, ps[{Λ}]}, {k, 3}]];\nnu[n_][xx_] := ν[n][xx] /. pt;\nopDir[tt_, Q_, xx_] := nu[1][xx] nu[1][xx + hN] nu[1][xx + 2 hN] Q[xx - hN] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> xx) nu[1][xx + hN] nu[1][xx + 2 hN] Q[xx] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> xx + hN) nu[1][xx + 2 hN] Q[xx + hN] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> xx + 2 hN) Q[xx + 2 hN];\nopDual[tt_, Q_, xx_] := nu[3][xx] nu[3][xx - hN] nu[3][xx - 2 hN] Q[xx + hN] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> xx) nu[3][xx - hN] nu[3][xx - 2 hN] Q[xx] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> xx) nu[3][xx - 2 hN] Q[xx - hN] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> xx) Q[xx - 2 hN];\n(* minimal-degree monic q with Q = zz^(s x/h) q solving op; {} if none up to degree 4 *)\nsolveQ[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{c, eqs, ns, res = {}},\n  Do[If[res === {},\n    eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[op[tt, Function[yy, zz^(s (yy - X)/hN) Sum[c[j] yy^j, {j, 0, d}]], X]], 10^-40], X];\n    ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], prec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n    If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, X, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 4}]; res];\n(* all data for one twist: right/left eigenvectors (left matched to right by eigenvalue), t_a eigenvalues, weights, Q's *)\nstateData[tw_] := Module[{twv = tw /. pt, tGn, mix, evR, vecR, evL, vecL, vals},\n  tGn = Table[Expand[tGt[tw, a, u] /. pt], {a, 3}];\n  mix = N[(tGn[[1]] + Pi tGn[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7, prec];\n  {evR, vecR} = Eigensystem[mix]; {evL, vecL} = Eigensystem[Transpose[mix]];\n  vals = Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[Chop[Expand[(N[tGn[[a]], prec] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]]], 10^-40], {a, 3}]], {ψ, vecR}];\n  <|\"tw\" -> twv, \"tGn\" -> tGn, \"vecR\" -> vecR, \"vecL\" -> Table[vecL[[First[Ordering[Abs[evL - evR[[A]]], 1]]]], {A, Length[evR]}], \"vals\" -> vals,\n    \"mu\" -> Table[First[MinimalBy[wts, Abs[(tt[[1]] /. u -> thN) - hN twv . #] &]], {tt, vals}],\n    \"qd\" -> Table[solveQ[opDir, tt, twv[[i]], -1], {tt, vals}, {i, 3}], \"qu\" -> Table[solveQ[opDual, tt, twv[[j]], 1], {tt, vals}, {j, 3}]|>];\nQD[S_, A_, i_, xx_] := N[S[\"tw\"][[i]]^(-xx/hN), prec] (S[\"qd\"][[A, i]] /. X -> xx);\nQU[S_, A_, j_, xx_] := N[S[\"tw\"][[j]]^(xx/hN), prec] (S[\"qu\"][[A, j]] /. X -> xx);\nSZ = stateData[zs]; SW = stateData[ws]; nS = Length[SZ[\"vals\"]];\nchecks[\"all direct and dual Q's found (z and w)\"] = FreeQ[{SZ[\"qd\"], SZ[\"qu\"], SW[\"qd\"], SW[\"qu\"]}, {}];\nchecks[\"deg q_i = λ1 - μ_i\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Exponent[S[\"qd\"][[A, i]], X] == Λ[[1]] - S[\"mu\"][[A, i]], {S, {SZ, SW}}, {A, nS}, {i, 3}]];\nchecks[\"deg q^j = μ_j - λ3\"] = And @@ Flatten[Table[Exponent[S[\"qu\"][[A, j]], X] == S[\"mu\"][[A, j]] - Λ[[3]], {S, {SZ, SW}}, {A, nS}, {j, 3}]];\nchecks[\"weights = adjoint weight multiset\"] = Sort[SZ[\"mu\"]] === Sort[Table[J0[k][p], {p, ps[{Λ}]}, {k, 3}]];\n(* QQ: polynomial parts, all states and cyclic (a,b;c) *)\nFlam[xx_] := Product[xx - θ + n h, {n, Λ[[2]] + 1, Λ[[1]]}] /. pt;\nchecks[\"QQ: Q_a Q_b^[2] - Q_b Q_a^[2] = (1/z_b-1/z_a) F Q^c\"] = Max[Table[With[{zz = SZ[\"tw\"], q = SZ[\"qd\"][[A]], qc = SZ[\"qu\"][[A, abc[[3]]]], a = abc[[1]], b = abc[[2]]},\n     maxc[q[[a]] (q[[b]] /. X -> X + hN)/zz[[b]] - q[[b]] (q[[a]] /. X -> X + hN)/zz[[a]] - (1/zz[[b]] - 1/zz[[a]]) Flam[X] qc, X]], {A, nS}, {abc, {{1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 1}, {3, 1, 2}}}]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"all direct and dual Q's found (z and w)\", \"deg q_i = λ1 - μ_i\", \"deg q^j = μ_j - λ3\", \"weights = adjoint weight multiset\", \"QQ: Q_a Q_b^[2] - Q_b Q_a^[2] = (1/z_b-1/z_a) F Q^c\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"129\" data-out-n=\"951\" data-sub-idx=\"22\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"34\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[951]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9em;vertical-align:-4.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">all direct and dual Q’s found (z and w)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg q_i = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">1 - </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_i</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deg q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">j = </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\">_j - </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weights = adjoint weight multiset</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">QQ: Q_a Q_b</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">[2] - Q_b Q_a</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">[2] = (1/z_b-1/z_a) F Q</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[951]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{all direct and dual Q's found (z and w)}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{deg q\\_i = $\\lambda$1 - $\\mu$\\_i}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{deg q\\^{}j = $\\mu$\\_j - $\\lambda$3}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{weights = adjoint weight multiset}\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{QQ: Q\\_a Q\\_b\\^{}[2] - Q\\_b Q\\_a\\^{}[2] = (1/z\\_b-1/z\\_a) F Q\\^{}c} \\\\\n  &\\to 0\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0f920a7e-fb0e-4ab4-8831-816618053eb0"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Wronskian (quantum Weyl) formula for every $T_\\lambda$\nLet $D_{k_1k_2k_3}(x)=\\det_{j,c}Q^j(x+k_ch)$, with $z_j^{x/h}$ stripped from each row. Expanding the vanishing $4\\times4$ determinant (rows $Q^1,Q^2,Q^3,Q$; column shifts $+h,0,-h,-2h$) along its last row reproduces the dual equation, so\n$$t_1=\\nu_3(x)\\frac{D_{1,-1,-2}}{D_{0,-1,-2}},\\quad t_2=\\nu_3(x)\\nu_3(x-h)\\frac{D_{1,0,-2}}{D_{0,-1,-2}},\\quad t_3=\\nu_3(x)\\nu_3(x-h)\\nu_3(x-2h)\\frac{D_{1,0,-1}}{D_{0,-1,-2}}.$$\nMore generally, with CBR $T_\\lambda(u)=\\det_{1\\le i,j\\le\\lambda_1}t_{\\lambda'_j+i-j}(u+(i-1)h)$ ($t_0=1$; $t_a=0$ for $a<0$ or $a>3$):\n$$T_\\lambda(x)=\\prod_{(r,c)\\in\\lambda}\\nu_3\\big(x+(c-r)h\\big)\\;\\frac{D_{\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2-1,\\lambda_3-2}(x)}{D_{0,-1,-2}(x)}.$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "casD[S_, A_, ks_, xx_] := Det[Table[S[\"tw\"][[j]]^k (S[\"qu\"][[A, j]] /. X -> xx + k hN), {j, 3}, {k, ks}]];\ncbrT[tt_, lam_, v_] := Module[{lp = DeleteCases[lam, 0], n, lc, ta},\n  ta[a_, yy_] := Which[a == 0, 1, a < 0 || a > 3, 0, True, tt[[a]] /. u -> yy];\n  n = If[lp === {}, 0, First[lp]]; lc = Table[Count[lp, _?(# >= j &)], {j, n}];\n  If[n == 0, 1, Expand[Det[Table[ta[lc[[j]] + i - j, v + (i - 1) hN], {i, n}, {j, n}]]]]];\ncontentP[lam_, xx_] := Product[nu[3][xx + (c - r) hN], {r, 3}, {c, lam[[r]]}];\nlamList = Select[Tuples[Range[0, 3], 3], #[[1]] >= #[[2]] >= #[[3]] && Total[#] > 0 &];\nchecks[\"t1,t2,t3 Wronskian formulas\"] = Max[Table[With[{tt = SZ[\"vals\"][[A]] /. u -> X, d0 = casD[SZ, A, {0, -1, -2}, X]},\n     {maxc[d0 tt[[1]] - nu[3][X] casD[SZ, A, {1, -1, -2}, X], X], maxc[d0 tt[[2]] - nu[3][X] nu[3][X - hN] casD[SZ, A, {1, 0, -2}, X], X],\n      maxc[d0 tt[[3]] - nu[3][X] nu[3][X - hN] nu[3][X - 2 hN] casD[SZ, A, {1, 0, -1}, X], X]}], {A, nS}]];\n(* CBR reproduces the fused matrices used for the SoV bases *)\ntFn = Association[Table[ab -> Expand[tF[ab, u] /. pt], {ab, {{1, 0}, {1, 1}, {2, 0}, {2, 1}, {2, 2}}}]];\nchecks[\"CBR det = fused tF eigenvalues\"] = Max[Table[With[{ψ = SZ[\"vecR\"][[A]]}, With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, maxc[(N[tFn[ab], prec] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]] - cbrT[SZ[\"vals\"][[A]], ab, u], u]]], {A, nS}, {ab, Keys[tFn]}]];\n(* quantum Weyl formula, all 19 λ in a 3x3 box, as a polynomial identity (multiplied through by D_{0,-1,-2}) *)\nchecks[\"T_λ = content product x D_{λ-δ}/D_{-δ}, all λ in 3x3\"] = Max[Table[maxc[cbrT[SZ[\"vals\"][[A]], lam, X] casD[SZ, A, {0, -1, -2}, X] - contentP[lam, X] casD[SZ, A, lam - {0, 1, 2}, X], X], {A, nS}, {lam, lamList}]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"t1,t2,t3 Wronskian formulas\", \"CBR det = fused tF eigenvalues\", \"T_λ = content product x D_{λ-δ}/D_{-δ}, all λ in 3x3\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"130\" data-out-n=\"960\" data-sub-idx=\"10\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"11\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[960]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">t1,t2,t3 Wronskian formulas</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CBR det = fused tF eigenvalues</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"> = content product x D_{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">-</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03785em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord\">}/D_{-</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03785em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mord\">}, all </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"> in 3x3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[960]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{t1,t2,t3 Wronskian formulas}\\to 0 \\\\\n  &,\\text{CBR det = fused tF eigenvalues}\\to 0 \\\\\n  &,\\text{T\\_$\\lambda$ = content product x D\\_\\{$\\lambda$-$\\delta$\\}/D\\_\\{-$\\delta$\\}, all $\\lambda$ in 3x3} \\\\\n  &\\to 0\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c953b501-65e0-4071-8780-41a153ab1ea5"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Reduction at $x=\\theta-2h$\nWrite $v(p)=(Q^1,Q^2,Q^3)(p)$ for the dual columns.\n- **Degeneracies.** The dual equation at $x=\\theta+h$ gives $v(\\theta)\\parallel v(\\theta-h)$. At $x=\\theta-h$ it then makes $v(\\theta-3h),v(\\theta-2h),v(\\theta-h)$ dependent. So $v(\\theta-3h),\\dots,v(\\theta)$ lie in one 2-plane.\n- **Reduction.** At $x=\\theta-2h$ every $3\\times3$ ratio collapses:\n$$T_\\lambda(\\theta-2h)=\\begin{cases}P_\\lambda(\\theta-2h)\\,\\dfrac{\\det_2[v(\\theta+(\\lambda_1-2)h),\\,v(\\theta+(\\lambda_2-3)h)]}{\\det_2[v(\\theta-2h),\\,v(\\theta-3h)]}&\\lambda_3=0,\\ \\lambda_1\\le2,\\\\[4pt]0&\\text{otherwise,}\\end{cases}$$\n  for any choice of the two rows. Only $(1),(1,1),(2),(2,1)$ survive; $(2,2)$ vanishes through the parallel pair.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* dual column at θ+m h with row prefactor z_j^(θ/h) stripped; direct column likewise with z_i^(-θ/h) *)\ncolV[S_, A_, m_] := Table[S[\"tw\"][[j]]^m (S[\"qu\"][[A, j]] /. X -> thN + m hN), {j, 3}];\ncolU[S_, A_, m_] := Table[S[\"tw\"][[i]]^(-m) (S[\"qd\"][[A, i]] /. X -> thN + m hN), {i, 3}];\nchecks[\"v(θ) || v(θ-h)\"] = Max[Table[Norm[Flatten[Minors[Transpose[{colV[SZ, A, 0], colV[SZ, A, -1]}], 2]]], {A, nS}]];\nchecks[\"v(θ-3h), v(θ-2h), v(θ-h) dependent\"] = Max[Table[Abs[Det[{colV[SZ, A, -3], colV[SZ, A, -2], colV[SZ, A, -1]}]], {A, nS}]];\nmin2[S_, A_, {m1_, m2_}, rows_] := Det[Table[colV[S, A, m][[j]], {j, rows}, {m, {m1, m2}}]];\nchecks[\"T_λ(θ-2h): 2x2 formula or 0, all λ, all row pairs\"] = Max[Table[Abs[cbrT[SZ[\"vals\"][[A]], lam, thN - 2 hN] -\n      If[lam[[3]] == 0 && lam[[1]] <= 2, contentP[lam, thN - 2 hN] min2[SZ, A, {lam[[1]] - 2, lam[[2]] - 3}, rows]/min2[SZ, A, {-2, -3}, rows], 0]], {A, nS}, {lam, lamList}, {rows, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}}]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"v(θ) || v(θ-h)\", \"v(θ-3h), v(θ-2h), v(θ-h) dependent\", \"T_λ(θ-2h): 2x2 formula or 0, all λ, all row pairs\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"131\" data-out-n=\"967\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[967]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.3682em;vertical-align:-6.4341em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.9341em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.5941em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.0941em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.57em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.07em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5459em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.0459em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.1141em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:2.2741em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"v