   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. SoV wavefunctions\n- **Kets.** $|\\Psi\\rangle$ is a right eigenvector, normalized by $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$. Since every $\\langle x_\\mu|$ is $\\langle x_0|$ times $t$'s at $\\theta-2h$, $\\langle x_\\mu|\\Psi\\rangle$ is a product of $T_\\lambda(\\theta-2h)$; for example $\\langle x_{\\{2\\},\\{2,0\\}}|\\Psi\\rangle=T_{20}/T_{10}$. With Section 6 this gives\n$$\\langle x_\\mu|\\Psi\\rangle=N_\\mu\\,\\frac{\\det_2[v(x_{21}),v(x_1)]\\,v_k(x_{22})}{\\det_2[v(\\theta-2h),v(\\theta-3h)]\\,v_k(\\theta-h)},$$\n  where $x_1=\\theta-(\\mu_{11}+1)h$, $x_{21}=\\theta-\\mu_{21}h$ and $x_{22}=\\theta-\\mu_{22}h$ are the B-roots.\n- **Bras.** $\\langle\\Psi|$ is a right eigenvector of the transposed $t$'s, normalized by $\\langle\\Psi|y_0\\rangle=1$. With the direct columns $u(p)=(Q_1,Q_2,Q_3)(p)$, which satisfy $u(\\theta-2h)\\parallel u(\\theta-h)$,\n$$\\frac{\\langle\\Psi|y_\\mu\\rangle}{\\langle\\Psi|y_{\\rm low}\\rangle}=N'_\\mu\\,\\frac{\\det_2[u(y_{21}),u(y_{22})]\\,u_k(y_1)}{(\\text{same at }y_{\\rm low})},$$\n  where $y_1=\\theta-\\mu_{11}h$, $y_{21}=\\theta-\\mu_{21}h$ and $y_{22}=\\theta-(\\mu_{22}-1)h$ are the C-roots.\n\n$N_\\mu$ and $N'_\\mu$ do not depend on the state, and the choice of rows and $k$ is free.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "x0N = N[Flatten[xB[x0pat] /. pt], prec]; y0N = N[Flatten[yB[x0pat] /. pt], prec];\nkets[S_] := Table[v/(x0N . v), {v, S[\"vecR\"]}];\nbras[S_] := Table[wv/(wv . y0N), {wv, S[\"vecL\"]}];\nketZ = kets[SZ]; braZ = bras[SZ];\nxN = Association[Table[μ -> N[Flatten[xB[μ] /. pt], prec], {μ, gtpats}]];\nyN = Association[Table[μ -> N[Flatten[yB[μ] /. pt], prec], {μ, gtpats}]];\npredX[A_, μ_] := With[{Tm = cbrT[SZ[\"vals\"][[A]], #, thN - 2 hN] &}, Switch[μ,\n    {{2}, {2, 1}}, 1, {{2}, {1, 1}}, Tm[{1, 0}], {{1}, {1, 1}}, Tm[{1, 1}], {{2}, {2, 0}}, Tm[{2, 0}]/Tm[{1, 0}],\n    {{2}, {1, 0}}, Tm[{2, 0}], {{2}, {0, 0}}, Tm[{2, 0}]^2/Tm[{1, 0}], {{1}, {1, 0}}, Tm[{2, 0}] Tm[{1, 1}]/Tm[{1, 0}], {{1}, {0, 0}}, Tm[{2, 0}] Tm[{2, 1}]/Tm[{1, 0}]]];\nchecks[\"<x_mu|Psi> = products of T(θ-2h)\"] = Max[Table[Abs[xN[μ] . ketZ[[A]] - predX[A, μ]], {A, nS}, {μ, gtpats}]];\npsiX[S_, A_, μ_, {a_, b_}, k_] := With[{m1 = -(μ[[1, 1]] + 1), m21 = -μ[[2, 1]], m22 = -μ[[2, 2]]}, (colV[S, A, m21][[a]] colV[S, A, m1][[b]] - colV[S, A, m21][[b]] colV[S, A, m1][[a]]) colV[S, A, m22][[k]]];\nNmuX = Table[(xN[μ] . ketZ[[A]]) psiX[SZ, A, x0pat, {1, 2}, 1]/psiX[SZ, A, μ, {1, 2}, 1], {A, nS}, {μ, gtpats}];\nchecks[\"x-side Q form: N_mu state-independent (all rows, k)\"] = Max[Table[With[{nm = Table[(xN[μ] . ketZ[[A]]) psiX[SZ, A, x0pat, rows, k]/psiX[SZ, A, μ, rows, k], {A, nS}, {μ, gtpats}]}, Max[Abs[nm/ConstantArray[nm[[1]], nS] - 1]]], {rows, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}}, {k, 3}]];\nchecks[\"u(θ-2h) || u(θ-h)\"] = Max[Table[Norm[Flatten[Minors[Transpose[{colU[SZ, A, -2], colU[SZ, A, -1]}], 2]]], {A, nS}]];\nyRoots[μ_] := {-μ[[1, 1]], -μ[[2, 1]], -(μ[[2, 2]] - 1)};\nphiY[S_, A_, μ_, {a_, b_}, k_] := With[{r = yRoots[μ]}, (colU[S, A, r[[2]]][[a]] colU[S, A, r[[3]]][[b]] - colU[S, A, r[[2]]][[b]] colU[S, A, r[[3]]][[a]]) colU[S, A, r[[1]]][[k]]];\nchecks[\"y-side Q form: N'_mu state-independent (all rows, k)\"] = Max[Table[With[{nm = Table[(braZ[[A]] . yN[μ])/(braZ[[A]] . yN[ylowpat]) phiY[SZ, A, ylowpat, rows, k]/phiY[SZ, A, μ, rows, k], {A, nS}, {μ, gtpats}]}, Max[Abs[nm/ConstantArray[nm[[1]], nS] - 1]]], {rows, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}}}, {k, 3}]];\nNmuXvalues = Thread[gtpats -> Chop[NmuX[[1]], 10^-30]];\n{KeyTake[checks, {\"<x_mu|Psi> = products of T(θ-2h)\", \"x-side Q form: N_mu state-independent (all rows, k)\", \"u(θ-2h) || u(θ-h)\", \"y-side Q form: N'_mu state-independent (all rows, k)\"}], NmuXvalues}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
