       "data": "Out[984]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{<x\\_mu|Psi> = products of T($\\theta$-2h)}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-58},\\text{x-side Q form: N\\_mu state-independent (all rows, k)}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-53},\\text{u($\\theta$-2h) || u($\\theta$-h)}\\to 9.1620969955340115391731039633985159259807289883276451489\\times 10^{-66},\\text{y-side Q form: N'\\_mu state-independent (all rows, k)}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-53}\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\left\\{\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,1\\right\\}\\right\\}\\to 1.\\,,\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\}\\to \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. -1.000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\left\\{\\left\\{1\\right\\},\\left\\{1,1\\right\\}\\right\\} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. \\to 1.50000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\to \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. -0.500000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,\\left\\{\\left\\{2\\right\\},\\left\\{1,0\\right\\}\\right\\} \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. \\to 0.5000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 \\righ… [latex truncated: 1856 chars total]",
