  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 8. Functional orthogonality and norms\n**Bracket.** $\\langle f\\rangle=\\sum_{n=\\lambda_3}^{\\lambda_1}\\frac{f(\\theta-nh)}{\\prod_{m\\ne n}(m-n)h}$, the residues of $\\rho=\\prod_{n=\\lambda_3}^{\\lambda_1}(x-\\theta+nh)^{-1}$.\n\n**Derivation.** Adjointness of the direct and dual operators under $\\mu=\\prod_{n=\\lambda_3}^{\\lambda_1+2}(x-\\theta+nh)^{-1}$, with $\\varphi=\\frac{\\nu_1(x+h)\\nu_1(x+2h)}{\\nu_3(x-h)\\nu_3(x-2h)}$, together with $\\delta t_1=$ const, $\\delta t_2$ linear and $\\delta t_3=0$, gives for each $(i,j)$:\n$$-\\delta I_1\\langle P^jQ_i\\rangle+a\\langle P^jQ_i^{[2]}\\rangle+b\\langle P^{j[-2]}Q_i\\rangle=0.$$\nSo $\\det N$, the $3\\times3$ determinant with rows $(i,j)\\in\\{(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)\\}$ and these three columns, vanishes between different states with the same twist.\n\n**Orientation.** $P^j$ are the **ket's** dual $Q$'s and $Q_i$ the **bra's** direct $Q$'s, as the SoV expansion requires.\n\n**Norm.** Let $c_0$ be the coefficient of the $(x_0,y_0)$ term $\\Psi_Q(x_0)\\Phi_Q(y_0)$ when $\\det N$ is expanded with the $Q$'s as symbols. Then\n$$\\langle\\Psi_A|\\Psi_B\\rangle=\\frac{\\det N[\\text{ket }B\\text{ dual},\\ \\text{bra }A\\text{ direct}]}{c_0\\,\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle\\,\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)\\,\\Phi_Q^A(y_0)},$$\nwith\n- $\\Psi_Q(x_0)=[Q^2(\\theta-2h)Q^3(\\theta-3h)-Q^3(\\theta-2h)Q^2(\\theta-3h)]\\,Q^3(\\theta-h)$,\n- $\\Phi_Q(y_0)=[Q_1(\\theta-2h)Q_2(\\theta)-Q_2(\\theta-2h)Q_1(\\theta)]\\,Q_1(\\theta-2h)$,\n- $c_0=1/(4h^6)$ and $\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle=9h^4$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "polesN = Range[Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]];\nwgt[n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hN, {m, DeleteCases[polesN, n]}];\n(* det N with ket K's dual Q's (state B) and bra Br's direct Q's (state A) *)\ndetN[K_, B_, Br_, A_] := Det[Table[Sum[With[{xx = thN - n hN}, wgt[n] {-QU[K, B, j, xx] QD[Br, A, i, xx], QU[K, B, j, xx] QD[Br, A, i, xx + hN], QU[K, B, j, xx - hN] QD[Br, A, i, xx]}], {n, polesN}], {ij, {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}}, {i, {ij[[1]]}}, {j, {ij[[2]]}}][[All, 1, 1]]];\npsiQ[S_, B_] := (QU[S, B, 2, thN - 2 hN] QU[S, B, 3, thN - 3 hN] - QU[S, B, 3, thN - 2 hN] QU[S, B, 2, thN - 3 hN]) QU[S, B, 3, thN - hN];\nphiQ[S_, A_] := (QD[S, A, 1, thN - 2 hN] QD[S, A, 2, thN] - QD[S, A, 2, thN - 2 hN] QD[S, A, 1, thN]) QD[S, A, 1, thN - 2 hN];\n(* c0: expand det N with the Q's as symbols (h symbolic); Qu = ket dual, Qd = bra direct *)\nrowSym[{i_, j_}] := Sum[(1/Product[(m - n) h, {m, DeleteCases[polesN, n]}]) {-Qu[j][-n] Qd[i][-n], Qu[j][-n] Qd[i][-n + 1], Qu[j][-n - 1] Qd[i][-n]}, {n, polesN}];\ndetSym = Expand[Det[rowSym /@ {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}]];\ntermSym = Expand[(Qu[2][-2] Qu[3][-3] - Qu[3][-2] Qu[2][-3]) Qu[3][-1] (Qd[1][-2] Qd[2][0] - Qd[2][-2] Qd[1][0]) Qd[1][-2]];\nc0List = Table[Coefficient[detSym, mon/(mon /. (Qu | Qd)[_][_] -> 1)]/(mon /. (Qu | Qd)[_][_] -> 1), {mon, List @@ termSym}];\nc0 = Simplify[First[c0List]];\nchecks[\"c0 = 1/(4h^6), same on all four (x0,y0) monomials\"] = (Simplify[c0List - c0] === {0, 0, 0, 0}) && Simplify[c0 - 1/(4 h^6)] === 0;\ngramZ = Table[braZ[[A]] . ketZ[[B]], {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\ndetZ = Table[detN[SZ, B, SZ, A], {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\noffR[mm_] := Max[Abs[mm - DiagonalMatrix[Diagonal[mm]]]]/Min[Abs[Diagonal[mm]]];\nchecks[\"<Psi_A|Psi_B> diagonal (same twist)\"] = offR[gramZ];\nchecks[\"det N^{AB} diagonal (same twist)\"] = offR[detZ];\nchecks[\"norm formula, same twist\"] = Max[Table[Abs[gramZ[[A, A]] (c0 x0y0 /. pt) psiQ[SZ, A] phiQ[SZ, A]/detZ[[A, A]] - 1], {A, nS}]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"c0 = 1/(4h^6), same on all four (x0,y0) monomials\", \"<Psi_A|Psi_B> diagonal (same twist)\", \"det N^{AB} diagonal (same twist)\", \"norm formula, same twist\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"133\" data-out-n=\"1002\" data-sub-idx=\"19\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"17\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1002]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.5723em;vertical-align:-5.0362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.5362em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.5603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5362em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0362em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.5362em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.0121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:1.5121em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0362em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.5362em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.6962em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c0 = 1/(4h</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">6), same on all four (x0,y0) monomials</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1962em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;Psi_A|Psi_B&gt; diagonal (same twist)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6721em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">54</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1721em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">det N</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">{AB} diagonal (same twist)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.6721em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6.801642148512331523547042033148060890976527701416589417</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.1479em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">63</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.3762em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">norm formula, same twist</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">53</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.0362em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
