   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Scalar product between different twists\nThe bra $\\langle\\Psi_{A,w}|$ is an eigenstate of $t(w)$ and the ket $|\\Psi_{B,z}\\rangle$ an eigenstate of $t(z)$, both in the companion frame. $x_0$ and $y_0$ do not depend on the twist. The formula of Section 8 holds for the full $8\\times8$ matrix, with each state's own twisted $Q$'s; nothing else changes.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "braW = bras[SW];\ngramWZ = Table[braW[[A]] . ketZ[[B]], {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\npredWZ = Table[detN[SZ, B, SW, A]/((c0 x0y0 /. pt) psiQ[SZ, B] phiQ[SW, A]), {A, nS}, {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"y0 twist-independent\"] = Max[Abs[N[Flatten[yB[x0pat] /. pt], prec] - N[Flatten[yB[x0pat] /. Thread[zs -> ws] /. pt], prec]]];\nchecks[\"mixed twists: all 64 <Psi_A,w|Psi_B,z> match\"] = Max[Abs[Flatten[predWZ/gramWZ - 1]]];\nchecks[\"mixed twists: smallest |overlap| (not a zero test)\"] = Min[Abs[Flatten[gramWZ]]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"y0 twist-independent\", \"mixed twists: all 64 <Psi_A,w|Psi_B,z> match\", \"mixed twists: smallest |overlap| (not a zero test)\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"134\" data-out-n=\"1009\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"6\" data-sub-end=\"6\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1009]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.8682em;vertical-align:-4.1841em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.6841em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.32em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.82em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.2959em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.1359em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.0241em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.5em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.1841em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.6841em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.5075em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">y0 twist-independent</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.0075em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mixed twists: all 64 &lt;Psi_A,w|Psi_B,z&gt; match</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.4834em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">51</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mixed twists: smallest |overlap| (not a zero test)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.3234em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.016983473773597230387353844143</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\">⋮</span><span class=\"mord rule\" style=\"color:gray;border-right-width:0em;border-top-width:1.5em;bottom:0em;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.1634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.6875em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:gray;\">⋮</span><span class=\"mord rule\" style=\"color:gray;border-right-width:0em;border-top-width:1.5em;bottom:0em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">967600757724214514337971128</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.1841em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[1009]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{y0 twist-independent}\\to 0.\\times 10^{-60} \\\\\n  &,\\text{mixed twists: all 64 <Psi\\_A,w|Psi\\_B,z> match}\\to 0. \\\\\n  &\\times 10^{-51},\\text{mixed twists: smallest |overlap| (not a zero test)} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.016983473773597230387353844143{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  &{\\color{gray}\\vdots}967600757724214514337971128\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3a56c99d-8f73-4eba-bebc-7064112ac5c4"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Diagonal frame: $\\Omega_{zw}\\cdot\\Psi$\n- **The ket.** $|\\Psi_{\\rm diag}\\rangle=P_{\\rm phys}|\\Psi_{B,z}\\rangle$ is an eigenstate of the diagonal-twist transfer matrix.\n- **The bra.** $P_{\\rm phys}\\,t(w)\\,P_{\\rm phys}^{-1}=$ `tGPzw`, so $\\Omega_{zw}P_{\\rm phys}$ is the $w$-vacuum bra in the companion frame. It is the weight-$(2,1,0)$ state with $t_1=\\tau_{\\rm vac}(w)$.\n- **The formula.**\n$$\\Omega_{zw}\\cdot\\Psi_{{\\rm diag},B}=\\big(\\Omega_{zw}P_{\\rm phys}\\cdot y_0\\big)\\,\\frac{\\det N[Q^j_{B,z},\\,Q_{i,{\\rm vac},w}]}{c_0\\langle x_0|y_0\\rangle\\,\\Psi_Q^{B,z}(x_0)\\,\\Phi_Q^{{\\rm vac},w}(y_0)}.$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "PphN = N[Pphys /. pt, prec]; PphInvN = N[PphysInv /. pt, prec]; OmN = N[Flatten[Ωzw /. pt], prec];\nchecks[\"Pphys t1(w) Pphys^-1 = tGPzw\"] = maxc[PphN . N[SW[\"tGn\"][[1]], prec] . PphInvN - N[tGPzw[u] /. pt, prec], u];\ntauW = Expand[τvac[ws][u] /. pt];\niVac = First[Ordering[Table[maxc[SW[\"vals\"][[A, 1]] - tauW, u], {A, nS}], 1]];\nchecks[\"w-vacuum found: t1 = τvac(w)\"] = maxc[SW[\"vals\"][[iVac, 1]] - tauW, u];\nchecks[\"w-vacuum has weight (2,1,0)\"] = SW[\"mu\"][[iVac]] === Λ;\nlhsD = Table[OmN . (PphN . ketZ[[B]]), {B, nS}];\nrhsD = Table[(OmN . PphN . y0N) detN[SZ, B, SW, iVac]/((c0 x0y0 /. pt) psiQ[SZ, B] phiQ[SW, iVac]), {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"diagonal frame: Omega_zw.Psi_diag = det of Q's (all 8)\"] = Max[Abs[rhsD/lhsD - 1]];\nchecks[\"diagonal frame: smallest |Omega_zw.Psi| (not a zero test)\"] = Min[Abs[lhsD]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"Pphys t1(w) Pphys^-1 = tGPzw\", \"w-vacuum found: t1 = τvac(w)\", \"w-vacuum has weight (2,1,0)\", \"diagonal frame: Omega_zw.Psi_diag = det of Q's (all 8)\", \"diagonal frame: smallest |Omega_zw.Psi| (not a zero test)\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
