  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 11. Summary of checks\nBoolean checks must be `True`. Numeric checks are residuals and must be below $10^{-25}$; the two \"smallest overlap\" entries are sizes, shown to confirm the comparisons are not between near-zero numbers.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "passQ[k_, v_] := Which[v === True, True, v === False, False, StringContainsQ[k, \"smallest\"], v > 10^-3, NumericQ[v], v < 10^-25, True, False];\nGrid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, If[NumericQ[#2], ScientificForm[N[#2, 3], 3], #2], If[passQ[#1, #2], Style[\"PASS\", Darker[Green]], Style[\"FAIL\", Red]]} &, checks], {\"check\", \"value\", \"\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
